01:06:39.113 --> 01:06:41.220
All the things that I'm saying right now.

01:06:41.220 --> 01:06:44.463
It's like, don't forget
what you're in college for.

01:06:45.300 --> 01:06:46.530
It's to study.

01:06:46.530 --> 01:06:48.330
It is to become

01:06:48.330 --> 01:06:49.240
knowledgeable

01:06:50.160 --> 01:06:51.660
about stuff.

01:06:51.660 --> 01:06:52.950
You better make good grades.

01:06:52.950 --> 01:06:54.870
How else am I supposed to know?

01:06:54.870 --> 01:06:56.760
I've got to look at your grades.

01:06:56.760 --> 01:06:57.903
I have to know.

01:06:59.130 --> 01:07:00.720
Stuff like that?

01:07:00.720 --> 01:07:03.150
Well, he does have an incentive.

01:07:03.150 --> 01:07:04.110
Be a good boy.

01:07:04.110 --> 01:07:05.360
For making good grades.

01:07:07.140 --> 01:07:08.343
He actually asked that.

01:07:09.810 --> 01:07:12.270
He was like, if I make
straight A's, will you,

01:07:12.270 --> 01:07:13.270
and then he proposed

01:07:15.540 --> 01:07:16.373
a prize.

01:07:16.373 --> 01:07:18.060
A prize?

01:07:18.060 --> 01:07:18.893
Oh.

01:07:18.893 --> 01:07:19.727
And I said-
Tell him

01:07:22.260 --> 01:07:23.883
it's a solidified future.

01:07:25.470 --> 01:07:26.730
I was like, "I'm not above this.

01:07:26.730 --> 01:07:29.130
Yes, I will incentivize
