01:07:36.420 --> 01:07:38.320
I think that's a little unrealistic.

01:07:39.690 --> 01:07:41.280
Okay.
So yeah. Locke's off.

01:07:41.280 --> 01:07:43.384
He's off.
He's off. He's gone.

