01:10:37.920 --> 01:10:40.200
It's a good education if you're into it.

01:10:40.200 --> 01:10:41.343
Proceed with caution.

01:10:43.170 --> 01:10:44.218
Don't blame me if it's not for you.

01:10:44.218 --> 01:10:46.230
This feels like a mild rec.

01:10:46.230 --> 01:10:47.063
Mild rec.

01:10:47.063 --> 01:10:50.102
It's a strong rec if
