objects from compost.

01:11:32.340 --> 01:11:34.410
So no one needs to dig
in with their hands.

01:11:34.410 --> 01:11:38.070
Number two, organic waste
accounts are about 40%

01:11:38.070 --> 01:11:39.690
of landfill waste.

01:11:39.690 --> 01:11:42.660
So there are major land use savings

01:11:42.660 --> 01:11:43.683
from composting.

01:11:45.450 --> 01:11:49.200
Also, digesters and bio
reactors capture methane

01:11:49.200 --> 01:11:52.800
and burn it for electricity
or convert it to

01:11:52.800 --> 01:11:54.030
renewable natural gas.

01:11:54.030 --> 01:11:57.990
The nutrient rich compost
produced can also be sold

01:11:57.990 --> 01:12:00.780
and the reactor conditions
are super optimized,

01:12:00.780 --> 01:12:04.650
so even bones are
composted within 60 days.

01:12:04.650 --> 01:12:06.690
Thanks for talking about
this. Love you guys.

